  "jei.harkenscythe_core.amulet": "Hold right-click to return to your bed, paid with souls and blood from your keepers: the Overworld Amulet in the overworld, the Nether Amulet from the Nether, the Ethereal Amulet from anywhere but the End.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.biomass": "Biomass gear repairs itself whenever you take in blood.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.creep": "Use a creepball on soul sand to grow creep. Till it with a glaive and soak it with blood from a Bloodkeeper, then plant a germinated biomass seed.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.crucible": "Right-click with a keeper or vessel to pour in souls (5) or blood (10). Breaking a filled crucible sets the essence free.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.glaive": "Hold right-click for a moment and let go: the charged glaive strikes everything in a narrow cone ahead for double damage and spills their blood on the ground. Right-click blood with a Bloodkeeper or Blood Vessel to take it in. Right-click creep to till it.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.keeper": "Keepers and vessels store souls (scythe) and blood (glaive). Hold right-click to drink: souls give a random effect, blood gives strength; both make you hungry. Talismans, amulets, the Necronomicon, the crucibles and the altars use what they hold.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.livingmetal": "Livingmetal gear repairs itself whenever you take in souls.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.necronomicon": "With two blood in a keeper, hold right-click until the ritual is done: every soul near you rises as a spectral servant. Pages are found in dungeon, temple, mineshaft, stronghold and village chests.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.scythe": "Hold right-click for a moment and let go: the charged scythe strikes everything around you for double damage, and every mob it kills leaves its soul behind. Right-click a soul with a keeper or vessel to take it in. Right-click sugar cane, wheat or a biomass plant to harvest it.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.spectral_dye": "Leather, soulweave or bloodweave armour crafted with spectral dye becomes spectral armour.",
  "jei.harkenscythe_core.talisman": "Carried in the inventory, it saves you from a deadly blow for souls and blood from your keepers. Attune it with a full keeper (or half a vessel) for other costs and effects.",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.amulet": "Teleport back to resting place",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.amulet.cost": "Cost: 5 Souls and 10 Blood",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.amulet.cost.blood": "Cost: 20 Blood",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.amulet.cost.soul": "Cost: 10 Souls",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.0.1": "A book containing religious texts",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.0.2": "and instructions for magical rituals",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.1.1": "A book containing religious texts",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.1.2": "and instructions for sacrificial rituals",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.2.1": "The Book of the Dead: Bound in human",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.2.2": "flesh and inked in blood, this ancient",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.2.3": "Samarian text contained bizarre",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.2.4": "burial rights, funeral incantations,",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.2.5": "and demon resurrection passages.",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.3.1": "A Missing page of the Necronomicon",
  "tooltip.harkenscythe_core.book.3.2": "writen in ancient Samarian text.",
